msgctxt "::725F7DBC4F48054CEF5D65AB2DCACBDB"
msgid ""
"A lighter is a portable device used to create a flame, and to ignite a "
"variety of combustible materials, such as cigars, gas stoves, fireworks, "
"candles or cigarettes. It consists of a metal or plastic container filled "
"with a flammable fluid or pressurized liquid gas, a means of ignition to "
"produce the flame, and some provision for extinguishing the flame. "
"Alternatively, a lighter can be powered by electricity, using an electric "
"arc or heating element to ignite the target."
